    "text": "<!doctype html><html><head><title>Senior Sales Manager DACH (m/f/d) in climate tech startup | Jobs at exnaton AG</title><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org/\",\"@type\":\"JobPosting\",\"title\":\"Senior Sales Manager DACH (m/f/d) in climate tech startup\",\"description\":\"<h1>Intro</h1><p><p>exnaton is a climate tech startup, spun out of ETH Zurich, which provides an AI-powered intelligence platform for new energy, enabling utilities to rapidly design, test, and scale smart, data-driven energy products - from energy sharing and dynamic tariffs to EV smart charging and flexible billing models. Our technology extends existing utility infrastructure with flexible, future-ready solutions, helping energy providers unlock new value from decentralized, digital energy - efficiently without large migrations and at scale.</p><p>We are a Switzerland-based start-up, and our vision is to lead the digital transformation of the energy sector worldwide, by empowering utilities and consumers to shape a flexible, transparent, and sustainable energy future.</p><p>Our team is growing and we are looking for passionate and talented people to complement our team. We are a diverse team, all driven by the shared goal of using technology to create a sustainable impact in our society. If you’re enthusiastic about contributing to this exciting journey, we invite you to be a part of our innovative and motivated team.</p><p>The job can be performed remotely in EU countries, but for this specific role, travelling up to 20% to DACH-based customers would be required.</p></p><br><h1>Your role</h1><p><p>In this position, you work alongside a collaborative team to drive new business in DACH, our largest and most developed market. You take ownership of the full sales cycle, from identifying new opportunities to closing deals and building lasting customer relationships, while working closely with colleagues in Sales, Marketing, and Product. Your responsibilities include:</p><ul><li><p>Acquiring new utility customers across the DACH region and owning the full sales cycle: identifying relevant accounts, initiating contact, qualifying needs, preparing proposals, and closing,</p></li></ul>\",\"identifier\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"exnaton AG\",\"value\":\"2810480-165906\"},\"hiringOrganization\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"exnaton AG\",\"logo\":\"https://assets.cdn.personio.de/logos/165906/social/e243b8934d9374d3be7a41de217854d4.png\"},\"jobLocation\":[{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Zeughausstrasse 31\",\"addressLocality\":\"Zürich\",\"addressRegion\":\"Zürich\",\"postalCode\":\"8004\",\"addressCountry\":\"CH\"}},{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"\",\"postalCode\":\"1010\",\"addressCountry\":\"AT\"}},{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"\",\"postalCode\":\"00-901\",\"addressCountry\":\"PL\"}}],\"datePosted\":\"2026-09-23\",\"employmentType\":[\"FULL_TIME\"]}</script></head><body><h1>Intro</h1><p>Trimmed fixture: the page body is left out.</p></body></html>"
